  "description": "A comprehensive .NET client library for the Emailit API v2. Supports all API endpoints including emails, domains, audiences, subscribers, templates, suppressions, email verification, contacts, events, and webhooks. Built on Flurl HTTP with full async/await support, dependency injection integration, and typed exception handling.",
